Package: MetaScreener
Type: Package
Title: A dual-mode framework that robustly and quantitatively screens directional gene sets through multi-dataset and multi-approach integration
Version: 1.0.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Dingkang", "Zhao", , "dingkang.22@intl.zju.edu.cn", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A dual-mode screening framework called MetaScreener (DiffMetaScreener
    and CorMetaScreener), which can integrate multiple datasets and multiple
    enrichment analyses while quantifying both the activation signal
    directionality and inhibition signal directionality of gene sets.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/FangZY-Lab/MetaScreener
